        "original_id": "6a6ee769-6c6d-584d-8d4b-1d50e334e87f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil Lord, Christopher Miller, Judi Barrett, Ron Barrett, Jorge Blanco, Joe Stillman, Dwayne Johnson, Jessica Biel, Justin Long, Gary Oldman, Seann William Scott, John Cleese\n- Companies: Ilion Animation Studios\n- Films: Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs, Planet 51, The Lego Movie, 21 Jump Street, 22 Jump Street\n- Books: Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs\n\nFacts:\n- The 1978 children's book \"Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs\" was written by Judi Barrett and Ron Barrett.\n- The 2009 film \"Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs\" is an American computer-animated science fiction comedy film loosely based on the 1978 book of the same name.\n- Phil Lord and Christopher Miller directed and wrote the 2009 animated film \"Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs\".\n- The 2009 film \"Planet 51\" is a Spanish and American-British 3D computer-animated science fiction comedy film directed by Jorge Blanco and written by Joe Stillman.\n- Dwayne Johnson, Jessica Biel, Justin Long, Gary Oldman, Seann William Scott, and John Cleese starred in the 2009 film \"Planet 51\".\n- Ilion Animation Studios produced the CGI-animated film \"Planet 51\".\n- Phil Lord and Christopher Miller directed the 2012 live-action comedy film \"21 Jump Street\" and its 2014 sequel \"22 Jump Street\".\n- Phil Lord and Christopher Miller directed and wrote the 2014 animated film \"The Lego Movie\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
